      "writtenOn": "2025-11-26T22:13:57Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Two points:\n\n- For consistency, can\u0027t we make the `Sub` implementations also take a copy rather than a reference? (I imagine this might require making `CGColorHostObject` support `Copy`, which seems unobjectionable to me.)\n- These trait implementations will be usable throughout the entire touchHLE crate, and perhaps will be used accidentally. It would be surprising to discover they are defined here, so I think it might be a good idea to move them to the same files that define the structs involved. You could add a comment there about the fact we\u0027ve implemented these traits to simplify animation code, if you want.",
      "revId": "5b7641c63e8c137964ac3ba71a26ed044af56ff6",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
